          "briefTitle": "Theraworx Bath Wipes Versus Standard Bath Wipes in the Reduction of Vancomycin-Resistant Enterococci",
          "officialTitle": "A Randomized Controlled Trial of the Safety and Efficacy of Theraworx Bath Wipes in the Reduction of Skin Colonization With Vancomycin-Resistant Enterococci Compared to Standard Bath Wipes in Children Undergoing Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplantation"
        },
